# Production release continuity

Read docs/PRODUCTION_FORWARD_BASELINE.md before any release. It supersedes the old Git-ancestry and newest-READY pin rules, which can discard preserved overlays.

- Do not deploy plain main or restore an older checkpoint blindly.
- Do not run automatic deploy:pin/deploy:lock alias mutation.
- Preserve the live source/overlays, stage and verify, then explicitly activate only the reviewed release on the authorized domains.
- If another owner is releasing, hand off rather than competing.
- FMS dual videos, FETMS service, Tasks checkout, Calendar, Courses, Templates and pricing must remain intact.
